//     fixed — which is what lets the two arms be subtracted;
//   - and the lanes fill up. At the down projection's K=640 a VEC=4 lane-step
//     is 20 loads, so 44 of a wave's 64 lanes idle through the whole kernel;
//     NROWS=4 gives that wave 80 loads. gate_up's K=2560 row already occupies
//     all 64, so the two shapes separate this effect from the other three.
